{"id":"s1-3-6","courseId":"s1","chapterNumber":"3.6","title":"Derivasjon av trigonometriske funksjoner","description":"Deriver sinus, cosinus og tangent, samt sammensatte trigonometriske funksjoner.","estimatedMinutes":50,"competenceGoals":["derivere trigonometriske funksjoner"],"content":[{"id":"s1-3-6-intro","type":"text","content":"## Derivasjon av trigonometriske funksjoner\n\nVi bruker **radianer** ved derivasjon av trigonometriske funksjoner."},{"id":"s1-3-6-regler","type":"theorem","title":"Derivasjonsregler","content":"$$\\frac{d}{dx}[\\sin x] = \\cos x \\qquad \\frac{d}{dx}[\\cos x] = -\\sin x \\qquad \\frac{d}{dx}[\\tan x] = \\frac{1}{\\cos^2 x}$$\n\nMed kjerneregelen ($u = g(x)$):\n$$[\\sin(u)]' = \\cos(u) \\cdot u' \\qquad [\\cos(u)]' = -\\sin(u) \\cdot u'$$"},{"id":"s1-3-6-example-1","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 1: Kjerneregelen","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = \\sin(3x)$ og $g(x) = \\cos(x^2)$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\cos(3x) \\cdot 3 = 3\\cos(3x)$\n\n$g'(x) = -\\sin(x^2) \\cdot 2x = -2x\\sin(x^2)$"},{"id":"s1-3-6-example-2","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 2: Produktregel","problem":"Deriver $h(x) = x^2 \\sin x$.","solution":"$h'(x) = 2x\\sin x + x^2\\cos x = x(2\\sin x + x\\cos x)$."},{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-1","number":"3.6.1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver funksjonene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = \\sin(5x)$","solution":"$f'(x) = 5\\cos(5x)$","expressionAnswer":"5cos(5x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = \\cos(2x+1)$","solution":"$g'(x) = -2\\sin(2x+1)$","expressionAnswer":"-2sin(2x+1)"},{"label":"c","task":"$h(x) = 3\\tan(x)$","solution":"$h'(x) = \\frac{3}{\\cos^2 x}$","expressionAnswer":"3/cos(x)^2"}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-2","number":"3.6.2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Deriver funksjonene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = x\\cos x$","solution":"$f'(x) = \\cos x - x\\sin x$","expressionAnswer":"cos(x)-x*sin(x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = \\sin^2(x)$","solution":"$g'(x) = 2\\sin x \\cos x = \\sin(2x)$","expressionAnswer":["2sin(x)cos(x)","sin(2x)"]}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-3","number":"3.6.3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Finn tangentlinjen.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Til $f(x) = \\sin x$ i $x = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$.","solution":"$f'(\\frac{\\pi}{3}) = \\frac{1}{2}$. Tangent: $y = \\frac{1}{2}(x - \\frac{\\pi}{3}) + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$."},{"label":"b","task":"Til $g(x) = \\cos(2x)$ i $x = 0$.","solution":"$g(0) = 1$, $g'(0) = 0$. Tangent: $y = 1$.","expressionAnswer":"1"}],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-4","number":"3.6.4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\dfrac{\\sin x}{x}$ og finn $f'(\\pi)$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{x\\cos x - \\sin x}{x^2}$. $f'(\\pi) = \\frac{\\pi(-1)-0}{\\pi^2} = -\\frac{1}{\\pi}$.","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-ex-5","number":"3.6.5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Finn stasjonære punkter til $f(x)=2\\sin x+\\cos(2x)$ for $x \\in [0,2\\pi]$.","hints":["Bruk $\\cos(2x)=1-2\\sin^2 x$ for å skrive $f'(x)$ som uttrykk i $\\sin x$."],"solution":"$f'(x) = 2\\cos x - 2\\sin(2x) = 2\\cos x(1-2\\sin x)=0$. $\\cos x=0$: $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}, \\frac{3\\pi}{2}$. $\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}$: $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}, \\frac{5\\pi}{6}$.","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Grunnreglene**: $(\\sin x)' = \\cos x$ og $(\\cos x)' = -\\sin x$ (med $x$ i radianer).\n- **Kjerneregelen**: $(\\sin u)' = u' \\cos u$ og $(\\cos u)' = -u' \\sin u$.\n- **Produktregelen** brukes på uttrykk som $x \\sin x$.\n- **Tolkning**: Den deriverte av en svingning gir endringsfarten — f.eks. hvor raskt temperaturen endrer seg.\n\n### Nøkkelbegreper\n| Begrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| $(\\sin x)'$ | $\\cos x$ |\n| $(\\cos x)'$ | $-\\sin x$ |\n| Kjerneregel | Gang med den deriverte av argumentet |\n\n### Viktige formler\n- $(\\sin(kx))' = k\\cos(kx)$\n- $(\\cos(kx))' = -k\\sin(kx)$\n- $(A\\sin(B(x - C)) + D)' = AB\\cos(B(x - C))$"},{"id":"s1-3-6-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver funksjonene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = \\sin x$","solution":"$f'(x) = \\cos x$","expressionAnswer":"cos(x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = \\cos x$","solution":"$g'(x) = -\\sin x$","expressionAnswer":"-sin(x)"},{"label":"c","task":"$h(x) = 3\\sin x$","solution":"$h'(x) = 3\\cos x$","expressionAnswer":"3cos(x)"}],"solution":"a) $\\cos x$  b) $-\\sin x$  c) $3\\cos x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Grunnreglene for sinus og cosinus.","Konstanten blir stående."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver med kjerneregelen.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = \\sin(2x)$","solution":"$f'(x) = 2\\cos(2x)$","expressionAnswer":"2cos(2x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = \\cos(3x)$","solution":"$g'(x) = -3\\sin(3x)$","expressionAnswer":"-3sin(3x)"},{"label":"c","task":"Regn ut $h'(0)$ for $h(x) = \\sin x + \\cos x$.","solution":"$h'(x) = \\cos x - \\sin x$, så $h'(0) = 1 - 0 = 1$.","answer":1}],"solution":"a) $2\\cos(2x)$  b) $-3\\sin(3x)$  c) 1","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gang med den deriverte av kjernen.","$\\cos 0 = 1$ og $\\sin 0 = 0$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Deriver og evaluer.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 4\\sin(2x) + 1$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 8\\cos(2x)$","expressionAnswer":"8cos(2x)"},{"label":"b","task":"Regn ut $f'(0)$.","solution":"$f'(0) = 8\\cos 0 = 8$","answer":8},{"label":"c","task":"Deriver $g(x) = x\\sin x$ med produktregelen.","solution":"$g'(x) = 1 \\cdot \\sin x + x\\cos x = \\sin x + x\\cos x$","expressionAnswer":"sin(x)+x*cos(x)"}],"solution":"a) $8\\cos(2x)$  b) 8  c) $\\sin x + x\\cos x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Konstantleddet 1 forsvinner ved derivasjon.","$(uv)' = u'v + uv'$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Sammensatte trigonometriske deriverte.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\sin^2 x = (\\sin x)^2$.","solution":"Kjerneregelen med kjerne $\\sin x$: $f'(x) = 2\\sin x \\cos x$.","expressionAnswer":"2sin(x)cos(x)"},{"label":"b","task":"Temperaturen følger $T(t) = 10\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}(t - 8)\\right) + 15$. Finn den største verdien til $T'(t)$ (eksakt).","solution":"$T'(t) = \\frac{10\\pi}{12}\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}(t-8)\\right)$. Størst når cosinus er 1: $\\frac{10\\pi}{12} = \\frac{5\\pi}{6}$.","expressionAnswer":"5pi/6"},{"label":"c","task":"Finn den minste positive løsningen av $f'(x) = 0$ når $f(x) = \\cos(2x)$ (eksakt).","solution":"$f'(x) = -2\\sin(2x) = 0$ gir $2x = k\\pi$, altså $x = \\frac{k\\pi}{2}$. Minste positive: $x = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$.","expressionAnswer":"pi/2"}],"solution":"a) $2\\sin x\\cos x$  b) $\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$  c) $x = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Ytterst er det noe i andre potens.","Maksimal derivert er amplituden ganger $B$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-6-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Produktregel, kjerneregel og tangent.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = e^x \\sin x$.","solution":"Produktregelen: $f'(x) = e^x\\sin x + e^x\\cos x$.","expressionAnswer":"e^x*sin(x)+e^x*cos(x)"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\sin(x^2)$.","solution":"Kjerneregelen: $g'(x) = 2x\\cos(x^2)$.","expressionAnswer":"2x*cos(x^2)"},{"label":"c","task":"Finn likningen for tangenten til $h(x) = \\sin x$ i $x = 0$.","solution":"$h'(0) = \\cos 0 = 1$ og $h(0) = 0$, så tangenten er $y = x$.","expressionAnswer":"x"}],"solution":"a) $e^x(\\sin x + \\cos x)$  b) $2x\\cos(x^2)$  c) $y = x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Begge faktorer avhenger av $x$ i a.","Kjernen i b er $x^2$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[]}